    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Colman Grimes Estate Agents present this turn-key two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment to the market. 25 Ballyowen Hall is a well-presented ground floor apartment benefitting from a private garden, secure parking and own door access. The property provides a practical layout and well-maintained communal gardens. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway leading through to the bright open-plan living and dining room. The kitchen is fitted with solid beech units and integrated appliances, offering ample storage and counterspace.  \r\n\r\n\r\nThe inner hallway leads to the family bathroom, master bedroom with built-in wardrobes, access to the private rear garden and ensuite shower room. The second bedroom is generously proportioned with built-in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBallyowen Hall is conveniently located in Lucan, with Liffey Valley Shopping Centre on your doorstep offering a surplus of amenities along with Fonthill Retail Park. There is an abundance of local schools and parks including Hermitage Park. There is easy access to the M50, N4 and ample bus routes in proximity to the development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious two-bedroom ground-floor apartment \r\n\r\nApprox. 60.77 sq.m / 654 SQFT\r\n\r\nBright open-plan living and dining area \r\n\r\nOverhead and base level kitchen units\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuite and garden access \r\n\r\nPrivate rear garden area \r\n\r\nGas central heating \r\n\r\nSecure parking within the gated development \r\n\r\nPopular and well-established residential location"
      },
      {
